	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			As anyone who has been playing Camelot the last few nights knows, we've been having some serious packet loss/latency issues. Fortunately, we've tracked down the culprit - an internal UUNET configuration problem - and it has been fixed. We'll keep an eye on it tonight, and everything should run normally. If the problems persist, we'll keep working on it. We apologize for the hassle you've been through, but everything should be ok now.<!--strDesc-->
